<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11754] Memory leak on the GridCacheTxFinishSync#threadMap</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11754</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;tt&gt;GridCacheTxFinishSync#threadMap&lt;/tt&gt; is not cleared when tx thread is terminated.&lt;br/&gt;
So, memory leak happens when transactions are executed inside new start/stopped threads.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
